---
description: Production Docker must be stack-aware, non-root, secret-safe and role-separated
globs:
  - "Dockerfile*"
  - "compose*.yml"
  - ".dockerignore"
---

For production Docker:
- prefer multi-stage builds
- do not bake secrets
- run non-root where practical
- separate web/worker/scheduler roles
- add health/lifecycle handling
- keep dev bind mounts out of production
- validate image build
- review ECS/Fargate compatibility
